- `SCOPE[COR-3.8b-ON-PATH-ROOT]`: `det δ(g̃₁h̃) = 1` follows only when ṽ ∉ ⟨g̃₁h̃⟩.
- Structure packages (F1)/(F2) from Lemma 3.7 and (S1)/(S2)/(S4) from 3.15's own proof are consumed as licensed, not re-derived (I did re-derive (S3)).

